+# Privacy Audit
+
+## Third-party audit (index.html)
+| Resource | Before | After |
+|---|---|---|
+| images.unsplash.com hero image | Hotlinked; leaked visitor IP/User-Agent/Referer to a third party | Self-hosted at `/assets/hero.jpg` |
+| Scripts, fonts, analytics, trackers, cookies, forms | None found | None; CSP `script-src 'none'` keeps it that way |
+
+## Data minimization
+- No client-side storage, cookies, or scripts; no personal data collected by this page.
+- `Referrer-Policy: no-referrer` (also set via `<meta>`), so URLs aren't leaked on outbound links.
+- `Permissions-Policy` disables camera, microphone, geolocation, payment and FLoC/Topics.
+
+## Secure handling
+- Strict CSP (no inline styles/scripts; CSS moved to `/assets/styles.css`).
+- `nosniff`, `X-Frame-Options`/`frame-ancestors`, HSTS, COOP/CORP.
+- `Cache-Control: no-store` so personalised pages (account/logout) aren't cached. Relax for `/assets/*` if caching is wanted.
+- `_headers` (Netlify/Cloudflare format) must be applied by the real host. `frame-ancestors` and HSTS can't be set via `<meta>`; the meta CSP is the fallback.
+
+## Follow-ups
+- The nav links to /account, /logout and /rewards; those pages need their own minimization review.
+- Publish `/privacy-policy` content; the link currently points to a page not in this repo.
+- Any future third-party script must be added to the CSP deliberately and recorded here.
